The text argues that compressing the future too soon is like mistaking the photograph for the waterfall.

31:36.700 --> 31:42.720
If you pick one future and ignore the rest, you are committing the noun fallacy on time itself.

31:42.940 --> 31:43.500
Exactly.

31:43.960 --> 31:47.860
Belief Geometry is the art of keeping possibilities alive in the mind.

31:48.500 --> 31:51.500
