35:37.040 --> 35:39.080
and software to prove this works.

35:39.300 --> 35:39.320
Yes.

35:39.440 --> 35:41.520
The 8B.IS stack.

35:41.700 --> 35:45.940
This is where the theoretical philosophy of the reachability ontology meets actual silicon.

35:46.200 --> 35:49.860
Or rather, seeks to replace standard silicon architecture entirely.

35:50.560 --> 35:50.980
Exactly.

35:51.180 --> 35:53.260
This is the domain of process-native computing.

35:53.420 --> 35:54.520
Process-native computing.

35:54.740 --> 35:56.000
I read this section three times.

35:56.000 --> 36:01.640
Since the dawn of computing, we have organized our machines around nouns, files, folders,

36:02.020 --> 36:07.060
applications, stored bits of data sitting silently on a hard drive waiting to be read.

36:07.180 --> 36:08.880
A completely static worldview.

36:09.100 --> 36:13.320
But if reality is made of processes, Flyxion argues our computers should be too.

36:13.700 --> 36:18.160
No files, no static applications, only propagating processes.

36:18.500 --> 36:21.060
It is a radical reimagining of the operating system.

36:21.060 --> 36:26.000
It is organized entirely around event primitives, inheriting directly from the SpherePOP calculus.

36:26.600 --> 36:31.980
The 8B.IS stack is an independent engineering effort that physically implements these theoretical frameworks.

36:32.200 --> 36:36.160
And it is comprised of four fascinating distinct layers.

36:36.440 --> 36:40.860
Let's walk through the stack, starting at the boundary where data tries to enter marine.

36:41.080 --> 36:42.660
Marine is the intake filter.

36:42.660 --> 36:44.740
It acts as an admissibility gate.

36:45.520 --> 36:48.980
In traditional computing, you check if data is in the right format.

36:49.540 --> 36:50.620
Is it a string of text?

36:50.740 --> 36:51.360
Is it an integer?

36:52.120 --> 36:53.520
Marine doesn't care about format.

36:54.000 --> 36:56.660
It tests incoming signals for structural coherence.

36:57.100 --> 36:59.440
It uses something called tangent constraints.

37:00.120 --> 37:02.720
How does a tangent constraint work in this context?

37:02.980 --> 37:06.840
Think of it as checking the geometric trajectory of the signal.

37:06.840 --> 37:12.960
Does this incoming data have a mathematical future within our system, or will it cause a contradiction?

37:13.360 --> 37:14.080
So it looks ahead.

37:14.420 --> 37:14.680
Yes.

37:15.140 --> 37:21.860
Marine uses these constraints to block structurally incoherent signals from even entering the system's semantic fluid.

37:22.460 --> 37:27.900
If a signal violates the basic geometry of admissibility if it's nonsense or malicious or contradictory,

37:28.560 --> 37:30.400
it is blocked at the gate before it can propagate.

37:30.580 --> 37:31.920
It's like a bouncer for reality.

37:32.420 --> 37:35.020
Sorry, your data doesn't have a mathematically viable future.

37:35.240 --> 37:35.920
You can't come in.

37:35.920 --> 37:36.900
Exactly like a bouncer.

37:37.280 --> 37:43.980
And if a signal is coherent and actually passes marine, it enters the memory layer, MM8.

37:44.100 --> 37:47.060
And I need you to explain this to me because MM8 is not a hard drive.

37:47.480 --> 37:49.260
It doesn't use binary ones and zeros.

37:49.480 --> 37:49.960
Not at all.

37:50.240 --> 37:52.780
MM8 is a wave mechanical memory physics.

37:53.340 --> 37:56.580
Memory in this system is not stored data sitting in a sector.

37:57.220 --> 38:02.360
It is active, interfering wave packets propagating through an RSVP field residue.

38:02.520 --> 38:02.980
Okay, stop.

38:03.080 --> 38:05.000
Explain how a wave acts as memory.

38:05.000 --> 38:09.420
If I want this computer to remember a specific sequence of data, how is that a wave?

38:09.680 --> 38:11.700
Think back to the three fields of RSVP.

38:11.900 --> 38:15.300
Each memory is defined by parameters that map directly to that physics.

38:15.980 --> 38:19.660
The amplitude of the wave corresponds to phi, the scalar accessibility.

38:19.900 --> 38:20.960
Okay, amplitude is phi.

38:20.960 --> 38:23.880
This determines how salient or prominent the memory is.

38:24.520 --> 38:27.160
A high amplitude wave is a core, critical memory.

38:27.640 --> 38:30.000
The phase of the wave corresponds to the vector flow VP.

38:30.640 --> 38:34.600
This dictates what other memories it aligns with, determining its associative pathways.

38:34.700 --> 38:35.940
So the phase is how it connects.

38:36.100 --> 38:36.300
Right.

38:36.660 --> 38:39.500
If two memories have similar phases, they link together.

38:39.640 --> 38:41.220
What happens when two waves hit each other?

38:41.220 --> 38:42.020
Interference.

38:43.020 --> 38:47.360
If two processes share the same semantic trajectory, their waves align.

38:47.900 --> 38:49.000
That's constructive interference.

38:49.400 --> 38:52.020
The amplitude, the phi value, increases.

38:52.520 --> 38:53.760
The memory becomes stronger.

38:53.860 --> 38:54.300
Makes sense.

38:54.460 --> 38:59.600
But if they conflict, if they represent contradictory data, destructive interference.

38:59.600 --> 39:01.540
The wave flattens.

39:02.060 --> 39:06.380
And this brings in the third parameter, decay, tied to S, the entropy density.

39:06.860 --> 39:08.920
And this decay parameter blew my mind.

39:09.240 --> 39:13.800
It means memories with high entropy memories that contradict the coherent structure of the system

39:13.800 --> 39:19.240
and get flattened by destructive interference literally dissolve into the background field.

39:19.420 --> 39:19.820
They do.

39:19.940 --> 39:22.460
They aren't deleted by a garbage collection algorithm.

39:22.880 --> 39:27.000
They organically fade away because they are no longer geometrically admissible.

39:27.140 --> 39:27.640
Precisely.

39:27.640 --> 39:30.620
It mimics biological and ecological systems.

39:31.280 --> 39:33.060
Forgetting isn't a failure in MEMAID.

39:33.500 --> 39:36.360
It's a structural necessity to keep the system coherent.

39:36.440 --> 39:37.360
That's so cool.

39:37.540 --> 39:41.140
But to prevent the entire system from dissolving into a flat line of chaos,

39:41.660 --> 39:45.160
the stack includes a vital regulatory layer called the Phoenix Protocol.

39:45.440 --> 39:46.280
