Cognition is navigation.

43:02.620 --> 43:03.860
Meaning is coordination.

43:04.560 --> 43:05.820
Nouns are illusions.

43:06.180 --> 43:09.260
You, listening to this right now, are not a noun.

43:09.520 --> 43:10.420
You are a process.

43:10.580 --> 43:11.680
You are a process.

